OL,3,GNEWSALearner drivers turn to YouTube
OL,4,Aand TikTok to cut costs - but
OL,5,Ainstructors warn of risks
OL,6,
OL,7,FLearner drivers say they are turning to
OL,8,Fonline tutorials to help with the cost
OL,9,Fof obtaining a driving licence.
OL,11,FDriving lessons in the UK are now about
OL,12,F#35 to #50, according to the RAC, with
OL,13,Fthe average learner needing 45 hours of
OL,14,Flessons and a further 22 hours of
OL,15,Fpractice.
OL,17,FMegan Kielthy, who passed her driving
OL,18,Ftest in August, said social media
OL,19,Fvideos "definitely" saved her money,
OL,20,Fbut she also had seen AI-generated
OL,21,Fimages and misinformation that she had
OL,22,Fwarned could confuse learners.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
