OL,3,GNEWSALearner drivers turn to YouTube
OL,4,Aand TikTok to cut costs - but
OL,5,Ainstructors warn of risks
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Driving Instructors Association
OL,8,F(DIA) said while digital education
OL,9,Fcould be "excellent" it should go "hand
OL,10,Fin hand" with practical lessons, and
OL,11,Fthat road safety was a matter of "life
OL,12,Fand death".
